      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Dedicated Closed Container Fleet Specifications &amp; Telematics for Bike Transport By Car Racks</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Long‑haul bike transport is a niche but growing segment of the freight industry. To keep bicycles safe and compliant with safety regulations, carriers use a combination of physical and technological safeguards. The four pillars of protection are closed‑container trucks, satellite GPS telematics, speed governors, and automated check‑post clearances.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
