    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Closed‑container trucks</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A sealed, lock‑able container protects the rack and its cargo from weather, theft, and accidental damage. The container’s bulkhead panels are reinforced to absorb impact and prevent the rack from shifting during transit. When the container is closed, the carrier can easily verify that no tampering has occurred before the vehicle enters a high‑risk zone.</p>
